        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Grade 2 Commercial Security Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn ANSI Grade 2 deadbolt, the Deltana Lock is available as single cylinder or a double cylinder function. This high security deadbolt is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit door backsets of 2-3/4 or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in polished brass, brushed stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-1-deadbolt-deltana-cl200lm\"><b>Deltana CL200LM Grade 1 Commercial Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grade 2 Single Cylinder and Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 2 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Lock cylinder: 6 pin solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>The housing is made of cold rolled steel and zinc dichromated finish for rust resistance.</li>\r\n<li><b>5 year limited mechanical warranty with a 1 year limited finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Grade 2 Deadbol:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\" UL Listed, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\"  no-lip square corner</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-CL200LM-specifications.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CL200LM Grade 2 Commercial Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeadbolt is available as:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted on both the inside and the outside by a key. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 2 Deadbolt, Deltana CL200LA",
                "description": "Deltana Grade 2 Commercial Security Deadbolt - An ANSI Grade 2 deadbolt, the Deltana Lock is available as single cylinder or a double cylinder function. This high security deadbolt is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit door backsets of 2-3/4 or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in polished brass, brushed stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.",
                "keywords": "DOR-Grade2-DB,  DOR-CL200LA, DoralLock CL200LA single deadbolt, Dorallock Grade 2 Commercial Deadbolts, DEL-CL200LA deltana commercial deadbolt locks, commercial Grade 2 Locks, commercial single cylinder deadbolts, commercial double cylinder deadbolts, deltana CL200LA single cylinder deadbolts, deltana CL210LA double cylinder deadbolts, deltana CL210LA double deadbolts, deltana CL200LA-32D, deltana CL200LA-3, deltana CL200LA-10B,"
